1vby|n|One who, or that which, slices; specifically, the circular saw of the lapidary.	a:1fju,32,6;k06,30,15;1cdz,12,5;1era,11,6;vdr,9,6~k06,30,15;1fju,32,6;vdr,9,6;1era,11,6;1cdz,12,5	v:120g,47,5;20k2,46,2;bu1,15,3;26ei,12,3~120g,47,5;bu1,15,3;26ei,12,3;20k2,46,2	V:26ei,19,5;1tuh,18,5;19k1,15,7;1tva,15,2;18h6,8,5;28ua,6,15;1uee,3,5~28ua,6,15;19k1,15,7;18h6,8,5;1tuh,18,5;1uee,3,5;26ei,19,5;1tva,15,2	n:3sm,93,3;1777,83,3;1y0t,19,1~1777,83,3;3sm,93,3;1y0t,19,1	N:obw,45,3;1lwk,43,7;1lv4,35,3;1eyh,34,4;20k0,29,4;pad,22,3;1tva,20,3;13gh,18,5;1zml,15,4;1695,4,2~1lwk,43,7;13gh,18,5;1eyh,34,4;1zml,15,4;20k0,29,4;obw,45,3;pad,22,3;1tva,20,3;1lv4,35,3;1695,4,2
